// Optional overrides. Copy to Config/Local.xcconfig (git-ignored), then `xcodegen generate`.
//
// This fork already has its own ids, distinct from Blinky
// (com.harrisliangsu.whenreset / group.com.harrisliangsu.whenreset)
// and from upstream org.littlebabylog:
//   app        com.harrisliangsu.littlebabylog
//   widgets    com.harrisliangsu.littlebabylog.widgets
//   app group  group.com.harrisliangsu.littlebabylog
//   CloudKit   iCloud.com.harrisliangsu.littlebabylog
// App.xcconfig already sets that container. Do not clear it here.
// Development and Production schemas are still empty until a Debug run
// with -lbl-init-cloudkit-schema and a CloudKit Console deploy.
//
// Leave the team unset until it is confirmed on the Apple Developer account.
// A historical team to verify is D2MBDWD85F; do not assume it until App Store Connect says so.
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
